  (text "BILL OF MATERIALS - POWER (Rev 2.0)
───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
Ref      Value       Package    Part Number        Notes
───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
U_LDO1   ADP151      WLCSP-4   ADP151AUJZ-3.3-R7  Low-noise analog LDO
C_VIN1   100nF       0402      GRM155R71H104KE14D  VIN HF decoupling
C_VIN2   10µF        0603      GRM188R61A106ME69D  VIN bulk
C_AIN    1µF         0402      GRM155R61A105KE15D  AVDD LDO input
C_AOUT   1µF         0402      GRM155R61A105KE15D  AVDD LDO output
FB1      600Ω@100M   0402      BLM15AG601SN1D      Analog/digital bridge
FB2      600Ω@100M   0402      BLM15AG601SN1D      DVDD_AFE filter
C_DVDD1  100nF       0402      GRM155R71H104KE14D  DVDD_AFE HF
C_DVDD2  10µF        0603      GRM188R61A106ME69D  DVDD_AFE bulk
D1       5.6V TVS    SOT-23    PESD5V0S1BL         VIN protection
R_ISO1   0Ω          0402      -                   AVDD isolation (debug)

DELETED from Rev 1.0:
  U_LDO2 (AP2112K-3.3)   — no MCU digital supply needed
  C3 (1µF DVDD input)    — removed with LDO
  C4 (2.2µF DVDD output) — removed with LDO
───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

TEST POINTS:
  TP_VIN      — Input voltage from carrier
  TP_AVDD     — Analog supply rail (measure noise here)
  TP_DVDD_AFE — Filtered digital supply for AFE VDDD pins
  TP_GND      — Ground reference for oscilloscope probe
───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────"
